OL,3,GNEWSA'Day of shame' for ex-council
OL,4,Aleader Jason Zadrozny as judge
OL,5,Aconsiders sentence for fraud and tax
OL,6,Aevasion
OL,7,
OL,8,FFormer Ashfield District Council leader
OL,9,FJason Zadrozny is due to be sentenced
OL,10,Ffor fraud and tax evasion
OL,12,FIn his role as Nottinghamshire county
OL,13,Fcouncillor, Zadrozny applied for
OL,14,Ffunding he claimed was to support
OL,15,Fheritage projects in Ashfield, but
OL,16,Fpocketed the money for himself
OL,18,FHe has been told he is "at risk of an
OL,19,Fimmediate custodial sentence", with the
OL,20,Fsentencing judge describing Friday's
OL,21,Fevents as a "day of shame" for Zadrozny
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
